{"sections":[{"slug":"双幺半范畴","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"双幺半范畴"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">双幺半范畴</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“双幺半范畴”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">双幺半范畴是一个范畴</span> $\\mathsf C$, <span lang=\"zh\">带有两个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">结构</span> $(\\mathsf C,\\oplus,0)$, $(\\mathsf C,\\otimes,1)$, <span lang=\"zh\">左分配律</span>\n$$\r\n\\delta_\\ell\\colon (B\\oplus C)\\otimes A \\overset{\\simeq}{\\longrightarrow}B\\otimes A \\oplus C \\otimes A,\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">以及右分配律</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">类似于</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">可在双幺半范畴上附加严格</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">对称等等条件</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}